-- Outer product as value (ex21): materialize the pairwise distance table. Twin of 21-outer-product-value.bqn.
-- Same world layout as ex20 (rows 0-2 towers, rows 3-6 creeps, rows 7-10 bodies); dist is registered as the .bqn's squared euclidean so the printed table pins its exact integer values.
-- The query prints the |Tower| x |Creep| table flattened row-major, one row per tower; the 2501 corner cell (t2,c3) pins ex20's < strictness.
--! registry ../registries/21-outer-product-value.reg
--! out 200 8200 8900 2401 36200 12200 28900 42401 3200 3200 900 2501

cross dist Tower Creep
